   BRONZE PATH (emergency only): search_tables + query_table_rows, or grep_corpus as last resort.
   - For CPI questions: get_cpi_index. For FX: get_exchange_rate. For fiscal year dates: get_fiscal_year_bounds.

2. VERIFY UNITS: After finding a value, check its units via get_table_profile(table_pk=...) on the source table_pk.
